ensure_milestone "M9 — Web Migration Discovery" "Inventory Flutter dashboard behavior and stabilize contracts for the Next.js migration."
ensure_milestone "M10 — Web Foundation & Auth" "Create the shared Next.js workspace, design system, API client, and browser-safe authentication."
